    {
      "source": "Begin creating an <code>UPSERT</code> operation for given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>domainType</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>domainType</code></a>创建一个<code>UPSERT</code>操作。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "By default, the table to operate on is derived from the initial <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>domainType</code></a> and can be defined there via\n<a href=\"../../relational/core/mapping/Table.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>Table</code></a> annotation. Using <code>inTable</code> allows overriding\nthe table name for the execution.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，要操作的表是从初始<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>domainType</code></a>派生的，并可通过<a href=\"../../relational/core/mapping/Table.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>Table</code></a>注解在此定义。使用<code>inTable</code>允许覆盖执行时的表名。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2017–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2017–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> Upserts currently do not support optimistic locking.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> 目前 UPSERT 操作不支持乐观锁。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"ReactiveUpsertOperation.ReactiveUpsert.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.core\"><code>ReactiveUpsertOperation.ReactiveUpsert</code></a> interface provides methods for constructing <code>UPSERT</code> operations in a fluent way.",
      "translation": "`ReactiveUpsertOperation.ReactiveUpsert` 接口提供了以流畅方式构建 `UPSERT` 操作的方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Trigger <code>UPSERT</code> execution by calling one of the terminating methods.",
      "translation": "通过调用终止方法之一来触发<code>UPSERT</code>执行。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Table override (optional).",
      "translation": "表覆盖（可选）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span id=\"upsert(java.lang.Class)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> of the application domain object.</span>",
      "translation": "<span id=\"upsert(java.lang.Class)-type-param-T\"><code>T</code> - 应用程序领域对象的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a>（类型）。</span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - if <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>domainType</code></a> is null.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - 如果 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>domainType</code></a> 为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>domainType</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> of the domain object to upsert; must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>domainType</code> - 要上送的域对象的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a>（java.lang 中的类或接口）；不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
