    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"ReactiveUpsertOperation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.core\"><code>ReactiveUpsertOperation</code></a> interface allows creation and execution of <code>UPSERT</code> (insert-or-update)\noperations in a fluent API style.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"ReactiveUpsertOperation.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.r2dbc.core 中的接口\"><code>ReactiveUpsertOperation</code></a> 接口允许以流畅的 API 风格创建并执行 <code>UPSERT</code>（插入或更新）操作。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<pre>    <code>\n        upsert(Jedi.class)\n            .inTable(\"star_wars\")\n            .using(luke);\n    </code>\n</pre>",
      "translation": "<pre>\n    <code>\n        upsert(Jedi.class)\n            .inTable(\"star_wars\")\n            .using(luke);\n    </code>\n</pre>",
